<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping - Tuticorin cargoes - Nov 6.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping - Tuticorin cargoes - Nov 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin's port on November 6:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>General		 --- (LDD) 3,150	Al Amin	     6/11</p>
<p>Granite	   3,183/- (LDD) 1,817	Hualien Express   3/11</p>
<p>General	    ---/169(LDD)   ---/256  Marianne Schulte  5/11</p>
<p>Logs	    * 4,658/- (ULD)   907	Ocean Rover	 1/11</p>
<p>Sulphur	   4,450/- (ULD) 8,022	Normar Pioneer    1/11</p>
<p>Logs	    * 1,193/- (ULD) 3,737	Jaipur		1/11</p>
<p>Coal	     19,135/--(ULD) 2,454	Maratha Prudance  3/11</p>
<p>Coal		  ---/--(ULD)20,694	Chennai Mermai    6/11</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>	    *   - In Cubic Metre</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
